      "Title": "Caesar.Mediator",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Caesar.Mediator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Default <xref href=\"Caesar.IMediator\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> implementation. Resolves handlers and behaviors from an\n<xref href=\"System.IServiceProvider\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> at call time, so it can be registered with any lifetime.\nHandler wrappers are stateless and cached per request type for the lifetime of the process, except for request\ntypes from a collectible assembly, whose entries go away when that assembly is unloaded.</p>\n"
    },
