      "Title": "Caesar.NotificationPublishers.ForeachAwaitContinueOnFailurePublisher",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Caesar.NotificationPublishers.ForeachAwaitContinueOnFailurePublisher.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Awaits handlers one after another like <xref href=\"Caesar.NotificationPublishers.ForeachAwaitPublisher\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, but keeps going after a\nfailing handler and throws an <xref href=\"System.AggregateException\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> at the end if any handler failed.\nUseful when every subscriber must get the event even if one of them is broken.</p>\n"
    },
